OL,3,GNEWSAImprovement but maternity still a
OL,4,Aconcern - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust's rating has improved
OL,7,Ffrom "requires improvement" to "good",
OL,8,Fdespite continuing concerns about its
OL,9,Fmaternity care.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Finspected the medical, urgent and
OL,13,Femergency, and maternity care provided
OL,14,Fby Gloucestershire Hospitals NHS
OL,15,FFoundation Trust in late 2025, and its
OL,16,Fleadership in February 2026.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
