OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1788265561
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAImprovement but maternity still a
OL,4,Aconcern - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the latest report, the CQC said
OL,7,Fthere was increased pressure on
OL,8,Fmaternity staff after the trust failed
OL,9,Fto fill vacancies, but teams were
OL,10,Fco-ordinating care effectively via
OL,11,Ftwice-daily meetings to identify if
OL,12,Fwomen needed to be induced.
OL,14,FThe trust said it has already made
OL,15,Fchanges to its maternity services in
OL,16,Fline with the findings of the report.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
